- This is an old portfolio, built in react and javascript, we'll update it slowely to use typescript and shadcn instead of plain js,
So in case you'll deal with scripts, write in typescript not JS and use shadcn components if exist.

- Regarding the color schema, lets make the new version slightly darker instead of emiraled green colors, supported both mode (dark/light)
And make the color pallete in separated place for easy change in future instead of hard-coding the colors on each component.

- We'll make this website as a single landing page instead of multiple pages, so ignore the other pages [about, work, and contact],
So apply the new features in the home page, separated in components that imported in the home page.

- Make the components SSRd as possible as you can instead of making it as a client component to get benifit with the SEO,
And use the function declarations for each component instead of the function expressions.

